Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,请大家注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have your attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请各位系好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To properly fasten your seat belts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slide the flat portion into the buckle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,机上其有6个紧急出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are six emergency exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,两个在前 两个位于机翼侧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two doors in front two over the wings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那个在后边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two at the rear of the aircraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员 准备起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight attendants,prepare for departure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不要怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 换个位?我想和贝丽坐一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex? Could you trade seats so Blake and I could sit together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她问过托德 他说他得了什么病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She asked Tod,but he had some medical thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up,dude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生 什么事? - 搞什么鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there a problem,sir? - What's your fucking problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机会爆炸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fucking plane's going to explode!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴!布郎宁 - 搞什么鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up,Browning. - You're so not funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不应该开玩笑… - 不是开玩笑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If this is a joke... - It's not a joke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex,take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 飞机会坠毁 - 乱讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sit down! - It's going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可能要下飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll remove you if this continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己会下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fucking remove myself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个座位是我的 - 游戏会继续进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's my seat. - This plane is going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,通道上的人 全都下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody in the aisle off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都坐好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay where you are.Sit tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,坐好 飞机会坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fucking plane is going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你跟他去 照顾他一下 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go check him out.See how he's doing. - Ok{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没有闹事 放手! - 放手 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get the fuck off me! - Let go,jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看着他 不要放他们上机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this? No one gets back on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:17:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我的命令 - 等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's my call. - Wait,please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我有40个学生去巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got forty students going to Paris.Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.51,0:17:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请明白我的立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must understand my position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do,and I apologize for Alex...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.37,0:17:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,机上的学生不能没有教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but one of us needs to be on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让这些学生自己去巴黎10天的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot let those students go to Paris for ten days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,卡特 停手!坐下 卡特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit the fuck down,Carter! Sit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们之中 只准一个上机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of you can go on the flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拉里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,机师态度强硬 只准你或我上机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not taking this well.One of us can get back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们迟三个小时后搭另一班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest can take an 11.10 flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你上机吧 你懂法语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the French thing.Get on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才上了厕所 才出来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi,I was in the bathroom,and the lock was stuck...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等 我没有生事!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait,I didn't fight with anyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,岂有此理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你父母正在赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called your parents.They're on their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 究竟什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex,talk to me.Tell me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看见飞机从跑道起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l saw it on the runway,I saw it take off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我从窗口望出去 望到地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw out my window,I saw the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,机舱开始震动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the cabin,it starts to shake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,左边飞脱 跟着飞机爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The left side blows up and the whole plane explodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看得清清楚楚 和真的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was so real,like how everything happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你见惯飞机爆炸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been on a lot of planes that blew up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你必定睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fell asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们延迟半日去巴黎…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get thrown off the plane and blow a half day in Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只因为艾力克斯做他妈的噩梦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All because Browning has a bad fucking dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 且慢…糟了 飞机会爆炸 飞机会爆炸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! The plane,it's going to blow up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧!卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you,Horton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去巴黎?进医院就有你份!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only trip you're taking is to the fucking hospital!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他! 艾力克斯 住手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off him ! Alex,stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,眼巴巴看着别人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they go,here we stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你赔偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're paying for my trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜你没留在机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you were on that plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贱人! - 哦 见鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You fucking prick! - Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快打电话 - 安保!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call it in! - Security!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么望着我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at me as if I caused this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不关我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't cause this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有人生还?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.27,0:20:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How should I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没有… - 这不是巫术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think I'm some... - He's not a witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫薛高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Howard Seigel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,运输安全局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}National Transportation and Safety Board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的家人接到通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've contacted all your families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,正赶来的途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁要见医生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anyone here who feels they might need...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁要见神父或是牧师?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}medical attention or spiritual counselling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事?有没有人生还?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Are there any survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸的原因未明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cause for the explosion is still undetermined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,救援队抵达现场后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nassau County authorities are on the scene...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,展开海上搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}naval search and rescue en route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 我是温纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.I'm Agent Weine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是希瑞克 联邦调查局探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Agent Schreck.We're with the FBl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白你们的心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand how you all must be feeling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这对你们非常的困难…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I know it's going to be difficult...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,趁记忆犹新…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we need to ask questions regarding today's events...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不得不问几句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while they're still fresh in your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,无论对于拯救 调查…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will prove invaluable to our rescue attempts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们所提供的数据 都很有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and any potential criminal investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你说:听我说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said,"Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机起飞后会爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This plane will explode on takeoff."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我有预感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的预感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This weird feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有服过镇定剂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you take any sedatives before boarding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在飞机上你有没有服用过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On board,did you take any sleeping pills...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.81,0:21:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,安眠药 或迷幻药?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}narcotics,hallucinogens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,吸不吸毒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you take any drugs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.57,0:21:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我预先见到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,见到将会发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,见到飞机爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the plane explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸前 你说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did the weird feelings have anything to do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"可惜卡特没留在机上"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your saying you wished Carter Horton was on it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你那样说 因为预感?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just before it exploded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 为什么那样说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why'd you say it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不以为飞机真的会爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't really think it was going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.81,0:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's the case,Alex...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么下飞机?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why did you really get off the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥叫我下飞机…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother George...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he told me to go keep an eye on Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.17,0:22:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,于是哥哥留在机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so he stayed and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.87,0:22:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,而我下机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me to get off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拉利叫我上机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry Murnau said I should get back on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但我认为他上机比较适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I told him that he should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫他上机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent him back on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.67,0:22:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.47,0:22:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人逼你下飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody forced you off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟下飞机的同学也不熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you weren't friends with those that were...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 那么你为什么下飞机?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so,Clear,why did you get off the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我看到 听到艾力克斯的情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I saw and I heard Alex...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I believed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.17,0:23:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你送我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,9点25分 180号班机…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are looking at the first piece of debris...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.91,0:25:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从纽约肯尼迪机场起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to wash ashore from Volee Air flight 180...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.47,0:25:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,随即发生爆炸 爆炸碎片…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which erupted shortly after a 9.25 p.m.takeoff...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开始冲上沙滩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from John F.Kennedy Airport in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.41,0:25:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,据悉未有生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no known survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机燃料仍在海面燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coast Guard and naval search and rescue efforts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.41,0:25:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,水警与海军…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are continuing at this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,正在海上搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even as jet fuel burns on the ocean's surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.37,0:25:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对于寻获生还者的机会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorities are pessimistic about the possibility...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,当局认为微乎其微\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of finding anyone alive from the ill-fated flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.21,0:25:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,287名乘客 可能全部遇难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All 287 passengers are feared dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,其中有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amongst the travellers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.47,0:25:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来自阿伯拉罕山中学…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a class of forty students and four teachers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.37,0:25:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,40名学生 4位教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Mount Abraham High School in south-east New York...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.51,0:25:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,该批师生拟赴巴黎参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}en route to Paris on a field trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.81,0:25:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,起机前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are reports several students...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.87,0:25:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,数名学生因事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were removed from the aircraft moments before departure...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,被驱逐下机 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}however,investigators remain guarded...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,详情未获披露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the specifics of this incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,运输安全局和联邦调查局…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorities from National Transportation and Safety...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.11,0:26:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,两局人员已经到抵达现场…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Federal Bureau of lnvestigation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.51,0:26:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,着手调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have arrived at JFKto begin the initial investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,机场与附近的长岛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyewitnesses at the airport,as well as on Long lsland...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.57,0:26:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,都有人目击这次爆炸意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}report seeing the plane explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.47,0:26:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,肇事上空 当时并没有其它飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No other aircraft were visibly near flight 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.11,0:26:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,航机控制员…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At JFK,air traffic controllers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.87,0:26:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,正研究目击者口供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are corroborating these eyewitness accounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.87,0:26:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸碎片…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the explosion,debris apparently rained...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,散播在大西洋数英里范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the Atlantic Ocean for several miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,目前 调查人员…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Investigators are cautious about verifying these accounts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,仍未能确定…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}believing they'll learn more...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.37,0:26:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,39日前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-nine days have passed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.97,0:27:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们痛失39位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since we lost our thirty-nine loved ones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.51,0:27:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱师友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}friends,and teachers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.37,0:27:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,空难的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As each day passes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.97,0:27:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一日未查明…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without a determining cause for the accident...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的心结一日不能解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we ask ourselves,"Why?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,圣经《传道书》这样说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ecclesiastes" tells us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.37,0:27:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡何时出现 殊难逆料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Man no more knows his own time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,人就像网中鱼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"than fish taken in the fatal net...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.61,0:27:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,笼中鸟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"or birds trapped in the snare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.17,0:27:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,死 往往突如其来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Like these,the children of men caught...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.36,0:27:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听天由命而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"when the time falls suddenly upon them."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,正当伤痛犹新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so,before we can heal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.87,0:27:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡阴霾 徘徊未散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before we escape the presence of death and time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.31,0:27:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谨立此碑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must mourn and celebrate theirs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.41,0:27:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,悼念亡魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with this memorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.97,0:28:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要自以为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't think because my name ain't on this wall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.81,0:28:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的救命恩人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I owe you anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.41,0:28:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.77,0:28:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们死去 我更应该好好地活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I owe these people is to live my life to the fullest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.61,0:28:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那就少饮酒为妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you stay off the J.D.,then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.77,0:28:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格干涉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you ever fucking tell me what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.31,0:28:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的命掌握在我自己手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I control my life,not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.07,0:28:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.57,0:29:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我在考车牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took my driver's test last week at the DMV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.81,0:29:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,考到最低分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a seventy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.07,0:29:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 总算及格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the lowest score you can get,but I passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.17,0:29:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道不 当我在路考时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing is,when I was done with the test...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,考牌官对我说了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know the guy that drives with you during the test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.21,0:29:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyways,he goes....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"年青人 你会英年早丧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Young man,you're going to die at a very young age."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.97,0:29:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的短命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.57,0:29:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放心好了 你吉人天相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now,not here,not ever,Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.87,0:29:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那我可以约仙迪出去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I ask out Cynthia Paster,will she say no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.71,0:29:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.17,0:29:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要跟我交谈 我怕了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to me.You scare the hell out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.37,0:29:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.07,0:30:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要误会 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to take this the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.61,0:30:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记住你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you,you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.80,0:30:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会记的你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I miss you,too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.57,0:30:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我爸爸不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my father,he doesn't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.37,0:30:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等他心情平复…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,when he gets over this thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.87,0:30:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我一同出城散散心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and me,we'll road trip to the city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.21,0:30:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去看扬基棒球队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}catch the Yanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.85,0:30:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.01,0:30:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.97,0:30:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I better go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.07,0:30:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,悼念文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing Ms Lewton showed me in class...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.26,0:30:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,柳敦老师叫我朗诵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're going to let me read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.51,0:30:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,正说出我的心声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says what I'm feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.77,0:30:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.17,0:30:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,全靠你 我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of you,I'm still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.87,0:31:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.37,0:31:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,俗语说 死期难料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We say that the hour of death cannot be forecast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.77,0:31:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,话虽如此 其实…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when we say this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.27,0:31:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们心底把自己的死亡…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we imagine that the hour is placed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.27,0:31:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,当作遥不可及的一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in an obscure and distant future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.87,0:31:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦也想不到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It never occurs to us that it has any connection...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.21,0:31:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,自己的生命…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the day already begun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.07,0:31:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可能随时终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or that death could arrive this same afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.27,0:31:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可能今天 今午\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This afternoon which is so certain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.17,0:31:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至可能 此时此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and which has every hour filled in advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.83,0:32:57.05,Note,,0,0,0,,(火灾与爆炸)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.13,0:32:59.16,Note,,0,0,0,,(各种空难)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.66,0:33:01.82,Note,,0,0,0,,(空难)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.87,0:33:07.66,Note,,0,0,0,,(机场运作)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.43,0:33:37.40,Note,,0,0,0,,(学生悼念会昨天举行)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.76,0:34:00.92,Note,,0,0,0,,(阁楼杂志)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.52,0:35:36.11,Note,,0,0,0,,(托德)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.86,0:37:24.48,Note,,0,0,0,,(黑箱车)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.87,0:37:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.77,0:37:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,托德呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Tod?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.67,0:37:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.57,0:37:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你预见不到吗? - 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Didn't you see it? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.37,0:38:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,托德下机 而哥哥没下机 你令他觉得很内疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You caused Tod so much guilt over George...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.87,0:38:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,于是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he took his own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.87,0:38:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 他不可能自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! He wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他想自杀 怎么会说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okey? He said we'd be friends again after you got better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.27,0:38:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等你心情平复 约我出去玩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he make plans if he was going to kill himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.37,0:38:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,华格纳先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Waggner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.20,0:38:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,华格纳先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Waggner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.77,0:39:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎成秋天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost autumn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.87,0:39:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只是六月底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only the end of June.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.17,0:39:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但什么都在转变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,but everything's always in transition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.27,0:39:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只要留意 即使在现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you focus,even now,just one week into summer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.67,0:39:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会感到秋意转浓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can almost feel autumn coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.11,0:39:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢预测未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like being able to see the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.47,0:39:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你昨晚为什么去托德家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why were you at Tod's house last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我从电视里知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen enough TV to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.07,0:39:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦探员去托德家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the FBl doesn't investigate teen suicides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.56,0:39:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是调查自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were there last night.That means,one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.97,0:39:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,而是调查撞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they still don't have a clue what caused the crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.71,0:39:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们至今还没有头绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they haven't ruled out anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.27,0:39:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,七个人事先离开飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the fact seven people got off the plane...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.31,0:39:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,已经够奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is probably weird enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.67,0:39:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个有异能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to mention,one of those people had a vision...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.11,0:39:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,预见飞机爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever....of the plane exploding...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.87,0:40:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机果然爆炸 那就是奇上加奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}minutes before it actually did is highly suspicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.87,0:40:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,最可疑的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it doesn't help that the visionary's friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.81,0:40:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他的朋友自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just committed suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.87,0:40:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你昨晚为什么去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why were you there last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.97,0:40:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这塑像是谁 知不知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.47,0:40:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.07,0:40:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,弹簧头是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Springy Head Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.07,0:40:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是你 不求形似 只求神似\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.Not a likeness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.71,0:40:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你带给我的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's how you make me feel,Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.47,0:40:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.97,0:40:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,像你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.Like you,the sculpture doesn't even know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.21,0:40:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,塑像不知情由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what or why it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.57,0:40:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,无所适从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's reluctant to take form...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.97,0:40:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,却肯定有一个理念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet creating an absolute...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.27,0:40:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一个抽像而不可解的理念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but incomprehensible attraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.17,0:40:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,四年中学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In four years of high school...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.97,0:40:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们未交谈过半句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we haven't said one word to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.97,0:41:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,机上你预感到危险 我也预感到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At that moment,on the plane,I felt what you felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.47,0:41:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你发慌 我才察觉是什么危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't even know where those emotions came from...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你能够预见危险 我不能够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you started freaking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.71,0:41:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能预感危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see what you saw,but I felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.17,0:41:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,危险仍未消除 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can still feel it,can't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.07,0:41:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那日所发生的事仍未完结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something from that day is still with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.77,0:41:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你预感到 我也预感到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know because I can still feel you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.87,0:41:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我昨晚也去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I was there last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.07,0:41:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未面对过死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never dealt with death before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.61,0:41:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可能只是疑神疑鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could all be in our head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.17,0:41:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有异样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just feels like it's all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.37,0:41:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,异样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.37,0:41:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们或者难逃一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Tod was just the first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.27,0:41:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,像托德一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的预感?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that something that you're feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.67,0:41:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.07,0:41:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,假如可以再见到托德见他最后一面…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could see him one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.67,0:41:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,或者可以弄明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.27,0:42:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,想见他 就去见好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let's go see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.47,0:42:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.87,0:42:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心跳得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gives me a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.57,0:42:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这个地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.07,0:42:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为做不应该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doing something I'm not supposed to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.67,0:42:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.07,0:42:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.77,0:43:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是他? - 我想是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that him? - I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.48,0:43:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么化妆成麦克尔?杰克逊一样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did they make him up like Michael Jackson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.37,0:43:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.07,0:43:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经不是托德了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it was that made him Tod is definitely gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.67,0:43:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.97,0:43:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,吵醒长眠的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll wake the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.17,0:43:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他的手为什么动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd his hand do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.81,0:43:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,化学剂…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chemicals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.27,0:43:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在血管流动 令到尸身抽搐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vascular flush creates cadaveric spasms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.47,0:43:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的 我是他的朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,I'm his friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.27,0:43:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.37,0:44:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么有这瘀痕?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are all those tiny marks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.37,0:44:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,被铁丝勒到皮下出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cuticle lacerations from pulling at the wire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.27,0:44:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,铁丝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulling at the wire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.47,0:44:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是死于自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he was pulling at the wire,he didn't kill himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是死于意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.57,0:44:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,人 没有横死这回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In death,there are no accidents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.71,0:44:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有枉死 惨死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no coincidences,no mishaps...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.81,0:44:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,只有注定的一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no escapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就像一只老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you have to realize is we're all just a mouse...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.48,0:44:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,被猫玩弄于指掌之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a cat has by the tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.27,0:44:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无论做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single move we make...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡毛蒜皮 抑或丰功伟绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the mundane to the monumental...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.71,0:44:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,停红灯 抑或冲红灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the red light that we stop at or run...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.27,0:44:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁做情人 抑或做陌路人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the people we have sex with or won't with us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.57,0:44:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,搭飞机 抑或下飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aeroplanes that we ride or walk out of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.57,0:44:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,都属于死亡程序 由死神…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all part of death's sadistic design...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.87,0:44:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,预先设计的程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ieading to the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.27,0:44:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,预先设计?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.37,0:44:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 如果洞悉了设计…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean if...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.97,0:44:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以逃出鬼门关?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you figure out the design,you can cheat death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.37,0:44:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你一下飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex,you've already done that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.21,0:45:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就已经逃出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by walking off the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你朋友已经死去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend's departure...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.47,0:45:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是说 死神为你们准备另一套新设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shows that death has a new design for all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你想活命 就要猜测…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you have to figure out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.57,0:45:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,自己会怎样死 几时死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how and when it's coming back at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.67,0:45:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 劫数难逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play your hunch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你想逃 唯有凭直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you think you can get away with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.17,0:45:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 记住…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But remember...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.57,0:45:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,欺诈和不尊重此设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the risk of cheating the plan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.71,0:45:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可引致愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of disrespecting the design...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.28,0:45:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,和恐吓你的内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could incite a fury to terrorize even the Grim Reaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.77,0:45:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不想知道个中道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't even want to fuck with that Mack Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.07,0:45:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK,then.Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.37,0:45:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们偷进来 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry we broke in,and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.47,0:45:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不知者不罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No harm,no foul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.47,0:45:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很快会再见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.57,0:46:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那个殡仪佬说 死亡是经过设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mortician said that death has a design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.51,0:46:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,即是有迹可寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about omens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.77,0:46:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们坐在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know,that just by sitting here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.46,0:46:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,喝咖啡 呼吸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by sipping this coffee or breathing the air...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.11,0:46:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能引起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or even crossing the intersection...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.28,0:46:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一连串事件…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we haven't started in motion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.37,0:46:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,最终导致我们若干年后死亡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the events that will some day lead to our death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.61,0:46:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,40年 10年 明天 几时死…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forty years from now,ten years,tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.57,0:46:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道 除非我们留意蛛丝马迹…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't,unless we open ourselves up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.07,0:46:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,及早洞悉那设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the signs it's willing to show us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.17,0:46:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.87,0:46:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有预见托德死去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see Tod die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.17,0:46:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就像在机上预见爆炸一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it happen again,like on the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.37,0:46:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有预见 但有预兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,it didn't,but it might as well have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.56,0:46:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从预兆也可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a message from something,Clear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.21,0:46:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,揣摩出设计端倪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or someone,hinting at a design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.31,0:46:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说八道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.07,0:46:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要找预兆 到处都找到预兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can find death omens anywhere you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.01,0:47:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,咖啡是黑色 黑色代表死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coffee starts with a "C" and ends with an "E".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.59,0:47:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样?我们喝咖啡而呛死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does "choke." We'll choke to death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.91,0:47:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的看法有一定道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to hear you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.17,0:47:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但不可以捕风捉影 走火入魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we'll go nuts if you start with this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.07,0:47:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,殡仪佬说 死是预先设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mortician said that death has a design,right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.01,0:47:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能无意中预见了那设计…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,what if you,me,Tod,Carter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.07,0:47:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,令你 我 托德 卡特…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terry,Billy,Mrs Lewton messed up that design?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.31,0:47:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莉 比利 刘老师…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For whatever reason,I saw death's plan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.51,0:47:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,逃出鬼门关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we cheated it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.27,0:47:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,即是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what if it was our time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.37,0:47:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该死而没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we were not meant to get off that plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们仍然大限临头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it still is our time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.57,0:47:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,果真如此 我们迟早死于非命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it is,then it's not finished...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.27,0:47:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而且早死多过迟死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we will die.Now,not later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.37,0:47:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,除非及早察觉蛛丝马迹 再逃出鬼门关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless we find the patterns and cheat it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.67,0:47:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听完你这样说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After hearing you,I do believe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.27,0:48:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信托德自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Tod killed himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.77,0:48:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,卡特 不要烦他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby,come on,not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.37,0:48:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,人全到齐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we have a reunion here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.31,0:48:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.47,0:48:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 几时搬走? - 几个星期后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When are you moving? - Couple weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.17,0:48:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可惜… - 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's too bad. - Carter,you dick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.97,0:48:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去一位良师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Losing our favourite teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.17,0:48:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 我有话说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys,there's something I need to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你要离乡别井 你们不可不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lived here your whole life,and now she's gotta move...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.07,0:48:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有危险!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in danger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.47,0:48:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吵闹了!你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! Both of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.96,0:49:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,人死不能复生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They died,and we lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.41,0:49:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.57,0:49:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,坠机的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not let this plane crash...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.27,0:49:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会耿耿于怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be the most important thing in my life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.81,0:49:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.37,0:49:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我要过新日子 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm moving on,Carter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.97,0:49:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要浪费时间…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you want to waste your life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.17,0:49:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,专找艾力克斯霉气 那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beating the shit out of Alex every time you see him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.91,0:49:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不如干脆死掉好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you can just drop fucking dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.27,0:49:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Alex there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.17,0:49:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 他在 等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi,Clear.Yeah,just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.57,0:49:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔又打来 接听吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Clear again.You want to talk to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.47,0:50:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 他在洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear,he's in the shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.37,0:50:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫他再打给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get him to call you back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.91,0:50:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.47,0:50:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's concerned about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.17,0:50:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm concerned about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不跟她谈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why won't you talk to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.17,0:50:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不跟我谈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.97,0:50:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你和妈妈很关心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,you and Mom have both been a big help...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.77,0:50:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我暂时没话说 有些问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's something I need to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.57,0:50:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己要先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before I can talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.31,0:50:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,想通想透\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.27,0:50:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,运输安全局…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The National Transportation Safety Board...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.17,0:50:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就180号班机的爆炸成因…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a new theory tonight on the cause of the explosion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.31,0:50:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,提出另一解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Volee Air flight 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.47,0:50:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,某个发动机的电路绝缘体…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officials believe deterioration of silicone insulation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.21,0:50:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可能出现剥落 导致…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on an electrical connector to the scavenger pump...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.91,0:50:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,易燃液体泄漏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may have leaked combustible fluids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.61,0:50:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,托德的座位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Tod's seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.87,0:50:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,接触到电制的火花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A spark beneath the coach cabin in the fuselage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.87,0:50:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may have ignited the fuel line,proceeding to the fuel pump...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.51,0:50:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,从而引起爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would have set off the catastrophic explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.57,0:51:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸的途径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The path of the explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.07,0:51:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,首先是托德 然后是泰莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First was Tod,then it was Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.37,0:51:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡秩序照旧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're dying in the order they would've died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.01,0:51:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's death's design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,下个轮到柳敦老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms Lewton's next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.37,0:51:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我一睡着就梦见泰莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whenever I can fall asleep,I see Terry Chaney...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.31,0:51:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,光天化日 突然…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in the day,out of nowhere...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.87,0:51:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,脑里响起自己的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear the sound of my own voice in my head...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.01,0:51:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我对拉利说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying to Larry Murnau...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.17,0:51:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂法语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No.You know the whole French thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.01,0:51:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你上机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Get on the plane."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.47,0:51:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,当日的情形 我总是念念不忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything reminds me of that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.97,0:52:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.31,0:52:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 所以打算搬走 换换环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm hoping a change will help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.77,0:52:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.87,0:52:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但我生于斯 长于斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lived here my whole life,you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.07,0:52:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一草一木都是愉快的回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everywhere I looked were great memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.26,0:52:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我只见到拉利和那班学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now all I see is Larry and those kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.27,0:52:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,望出去前院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just looking out my own front yard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.96,0:52:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不寒而栗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes me feel nothing but fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.67,0:52:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,罗拉 我再打给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laura,I'm going to have to call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.01,0:52:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.27,0:52:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我是瓦莱丽·柳敦 请问希瑞克探员在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Valerie Lewton.I need Agent Schreck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.77,0:53:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.81,0:53:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.17,0:53:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,查查车胎 看看安不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}checking the air in the tyre to make sure it's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.07,0:53:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,绑好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on your seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.77,0:54:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.47,0:54:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是柳敦老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Ms Lewton is next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.37,0:54:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.47,0:54:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对 下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,next,because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.24,0:54:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有个模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's this pattern that's occurring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.57,0:54:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,模式?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.A pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.57,0:54:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你也察觉到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You noticed that,too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.67,0:54:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈爱听的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom's favourite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.87,0:55:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么模式?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what about this pattern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.87,0:55:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你又预见到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see it in one of your visions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.21,0:55:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,突然心血来潮?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you catch it in some TV static?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.27,0:55:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有故弄玄虚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never asked for what happened on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.76,0:55:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要嘲笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are going to sit there and make fun of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.57,0:55:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管嘲笑好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.67,0:55:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的确救了机上六条人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I saved six lives on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.31,0:55:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,同学个个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six lives,and everybody in my entire school...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.71,0:55:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当我怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thinks I'm a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.17,0:55:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我并没有受惊过度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not suffering from post-traumatic stress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.17,0:55:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也不以为自己是耶稣再世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a narcissistic deity complex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.47,0:55:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是杀人狂魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going Dahmer on you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,只是照实直说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.17,0:55:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们人人都有个模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a pattern for us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你有 你也有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a pattern for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.37,0:55:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都有设定模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a design for everyone,and I don't know how yet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.77,0:55:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定破解这个谜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm going to break this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.17,0:57:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came to our attention...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.07,0:57:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你难避嫌疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you were under suspicion in this plane explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.51,0:57:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.17,0:57:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你没有下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you didn't blow up the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.11,0:57:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,于是追寻其它线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were ready to move on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.97,0:57:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但生还者一个个死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then the other survivors started to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,首先是你朋友托德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First,your friend Tod...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.17,0:57:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着是泰莉 当时你在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then Terry Chaney,while you were at the scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.97,0:57:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚 你在柳敦小姐家外出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tonight,we pick you up at Val Lewton's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.31,0:57:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也不能够控制生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody has control over life and death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.17,0:57:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,除非是杀生或者寻死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless they are taking lives and causing death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.87,0:57:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以保证再不搞出人命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you promise me no one else is going to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.71,0:57:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.08,0:57:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,被扣留着 怎样保证?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as I'm in here,it's out of my control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.07,0:57:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.53,0:57:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.47,0:57:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这小子还真邪门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kid gives me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没证据控告他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do? We got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.67,0:58:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是指控告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.01,0:58:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有好几次…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were a couple of moments...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.97,0:58:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I almost believed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.17,0:58:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 有时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take this the wrong way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.47,0:58:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你也邪门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but sometimes you give me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.27,0:58:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,神经衰弱 这只是一只杯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to stop this.It's a stupid mug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你会离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.67,0:58:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很快你就离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty soon you'll be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.41,0:58:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.88,1:01:01.51,Note,,0,0,0,,柳敦老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.36,1:01:12.33,Note,,0,0,0,,柳敦老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.60,1:01:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事?不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,just stay still,OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.27,1:01:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,柳敦老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God,Ms Lewton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.67,1:02:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真有你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.37,1:02:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.97,1:02:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他不理我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not talking to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.97,1:02:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.57,1:02:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I didn't believe him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.77,1:02:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,假如有他消息…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he does contact you,I think it would be...{\r}
