Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.47,1:19:15.41,Note,,0,0,0,,(教师神秘烧死 余生者涉嫌)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.18,1:19:19.41,Note,,0,0,0,,(家长设立纪念助学金)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.97,1:19:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有换过位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.07,1:19:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,姬丝黛叫我换位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christa asked me to change,but I never moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.96,1:19:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没坐在托德旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have been up next to Tod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.17,1:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 为什么现在才察觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck! Why didn't I remember that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我没换过位 克莱尔坐在我前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never moved.Clear's seat was in front of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.47,1:19:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个轮到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.37,1:20:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,上车!沿湖畔开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car! We're going around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.77,1:21:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在那里! - 追!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There! - Come on,let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.14,1:22:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我们想帮你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex,we're trying to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.07,1:22:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,走开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prince! Get away from it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.47,1:22:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.07,1:22:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.37,1:23:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,给他逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.77,1:23:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他向那处走 必定去克莱尔家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the direction,there's only one place he's heading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.47,1:23:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.27,1:25:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.47,1:25:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move! Stay there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.17,1:25:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动!什么都不要碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.77,1:25:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰任何东西 车胎不导电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch anything.You're grounded by the tyres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.27,1:26:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,车快要爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car's going to explode!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.17,1:26:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能抓住电缆一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only hold on for so long.You know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.77,1:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.27,1:26:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要避过这一次就安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I do this,it'll skip you,and it'll all be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.91,1:26:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一逃出鬼门关的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way we can cheat death again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.01,1:26:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.67,1:26:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 与其同归于尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not going to let it beat us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.11,1:26:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我死你活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.57,1:26:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会长伴你左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.57,1:26:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.00,1:26:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 走开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.97,1:27:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要死 不可以为我牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it! You can't do this to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.07,1:27:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,活下去 艾力克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,baby.Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.27,1:27:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 他没有呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit,he's not breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.37,1:27:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要死 艾力克斯 呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on,Alex.Come on.Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.27,1:28:05.43,Note,,0,0,0,,(六个月后)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.27,1:28:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,安全到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,we made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.97,1:28:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,巴黎 想不到啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paris.I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.27,1:28:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们竟然再搭飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we got on a plane again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.27,1:28:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我想说什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.55,1:28:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,想不到终于来到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's weird being here,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.20,1:28:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,终于破解了天机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We finally completed a puzzle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.67,1:28:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还未完全明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just there's something missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.51,1:28:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.97,1:29:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,托德…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to Tod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.87,1:29:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所有来不到的朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To all of our friends that can't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.61,1:29:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,向他们干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.77,1:29:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.07,1:29:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,六个月前 我怎也不相信…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you would've told me six months ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.97,1:29:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在这里喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the three of us would be sitting here having a drink...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.37,1:29:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 有时候 似乎…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.Sometimes it feels like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.11,1:29:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你们才明白个中玄机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you two are the only ones who understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.07,1:29:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right,Browning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.47,1:29:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡是早有安排的 我们躲避过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It did skip us.There was a design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.57,1:29:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟死神斗 斗赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We beat it.We won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.77,1:29:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们更应该好好做人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing we won is a chance at a full life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.07,1:29:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不要浪费这机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance that I won't ever waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.41,1:29:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有一点我还不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's just something I can't figure out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.27,1:29:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪一点? - 关于死亡设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- About what? - The design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 算了吧 好不好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let it go,all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.81,1:29:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且听我说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear me out,all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.87,1:30:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又来了 - 爆炸的途径…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,my God. - Just listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.47,1:30:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,决定我们死亡的次序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The explosion path determined the order of our deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.17,1:30:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我插手 救了卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I intervened and saved Carter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.37,1:30:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡越他而过 降临在比利身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it skipped him and went to the next person...Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.21,1:30:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着是克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it was Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.57,1:30:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我插手 救了她 于是轮到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I intervened and saved her,so it went to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.71,1:30:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有人插手救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in my case,no one intervened,right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.37,1:30:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿着电缆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thrown from that power line...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.11,1:30:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,被炸到弹开…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the explosion,so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.97,1:30:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你奇怪自己为什么死不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why did it skip you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.07,1:30:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可能你注定命不该绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know this isn't what was meant to happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.37,1:30:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,180班机里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That out of everyone on flight 180...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.47,1:30:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你 我 卡特注定生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you,me,and Carter were meant to live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.77,1:30:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,或者由始至终就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that was the design all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.17,1:30:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 否则 下个轮到你 - 闭嘴 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Or you could still be next. - Shut up,Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.87,1:30:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,规矩不是我订\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't make up the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.67,1:30:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有人插手 死亡才越过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's got to intervene before death can skip them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.17,1:30:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯三度插手 确有其事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex proved that three times with the plane,me,and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.47,1:30:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可能还要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For all I know,it could circle back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.51,1:30:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,轮着死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get us all again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.37,1:30:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我最安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am the safest fucker in the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.21,1:30:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你还是下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you're still next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.47,1:31:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再提 好不好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we just stop talking about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.81,1:31:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们算一下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's figure out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.97,1:31:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,回酒店吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you back at the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.47,1:31:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等 我跟你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.77,1:31:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来 不要跟着来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,just stay here,OK,Clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.81,1:31:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,行不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.97,1:31:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不出所料 你是下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? It's true.I told you you were next,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.71,1:31:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 卡特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it,Carter.Alex,wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.42,1:31:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔 等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear,stay there,OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.11,1:31:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要走过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.47,1:32:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早说过 你是下一个 - 那就越我而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you you were next! - It skipped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.21,1:32:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下个轮到谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who's next?{\r}
